  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Center Advancing Preventing Violent Extremism Policy and Practice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overreaching objective of the project is to improve Preventing and combatting violent extremism in fragile and conflict-affected contexts in developing countries  through four mutually reinforcing sub-objectives: 

1) Reinforcing relevant international norms and structures
2) Supporting communities to address the underlying conditions that give rise to conflict and violent extremism 
3) Denying resources to violent extremist organizations while safeguarding civic space and financial inclusion 
4) Strengthening the criminal justice capacities of governments to prevent and respond to violent extremism</narrative>
  </description>
